#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_show_as
msgid ""
"Availability given to a new block of this type. A busy block is not offered "
"for online booking."
msgstr ""
"Disponibilité donnée à une nouvelle plage de ce type. Une plage occupée "
"n'est pas offerte à la prise de rendez-vous en ligne."

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_calendar_block.selection__calendar_event_type__bf_block_show_as__free
msgid "Available"
msgstr "Disponible"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_sequence
msgid "Block order"
msgstr "Ordre des plages"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_calendar_block.selection__calendar_event_type__bf_block_show_as__busy
msgid "Busy"
msgstr "Occupé"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_calendar_block.model_calendar_event
msgid "Calendar Event"
msgstr "Événement du calendrier"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_calendar_block.model_calendar_event_type
msgid "Event Meeting Type"
msgstr "Type de rendez-vous"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_is_block
msgid ""
"Events with this tag are blocks of time booked for a kind of work (focus, "
"production, catch-up…): they show its pictogram and colour in the calendar."
msgstr ""
"Les événements qui portent cette étiquette sont des plages de temps "
"réservées à un type de travail (concentration, production, rattrapage…) : "
"ils en montrent le pictogramme et la couleur dans le calendrier."

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_calendar_block.selection__calendar_event_type__bf_block_privacy__confidential
msgid "Only internal users"
msgstr "Utilisateurs internes seulement"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_sequence
msgid ""
"Order of the block types in the quick-create dialog. When an event carries "
"several block tags, the first one is its type."
msgstr ""
"Ordre des types de plage dans la création rapide. Quand un événement porte "
"plusieurs étiquettes de plage, la première donne son type."

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event__bf_block_glyph
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_glyph
msgid "Pictogram"
msgstr "Pictogramme"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_privacy
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Confidentialité"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_privacy
msgid ""
"Privacy given to a new block of this type. Empty: the organizer's default "
"privacy."
msgstr ""
"Confidentialité donnée à une nouvelle plage de ce type. Vide : la "
"confidentialité par défaut de l'organisateur."

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_calendar_block.selection__calendar_event_type__bf_block_privacy__private
msgid "Private"
msgstr "Privée"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_calendar_block.selection__calendar_event_type__bf_block_privacy__public
msgid "Public"
msgstr "Publique"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_show_as
msgid "Shown as"
msgstr "Afficher comme"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event__bf_block_glyph
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_block_glyph
msgid "Shown before the title of the block in the calendar."
msgstr "Affiché devant le titre de la plage dans le calendrier."

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event__bf_block_type_id
msgid ""
"The kind of work this block of time is booked for. Stored as one of the "
"event's tags, so that it reaches other calendars."
msgstr ""
"Le type de travail pour lequel cette plage de temps est réservée. Gardé "
"comme une des étiquettes de l'événement, pour qu'il parvienne aux autres "
"calendriers."

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event__bf_block_type_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_calendar_block.field_calendar_event_type__bf_is_block
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_calendar_block.view_calendar_event_search_block
msgid "Work block"
msgstr "Plage de travail"

#. module: bf_calendar_block
#: model:bf.color.rule,name:bf_calendar_block.bf_color_rule_block
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_calendar_block.view_calendar_event_search_block
msgid "Work blocks"
msgstr "Plages de travail"
